Omarchy is an opinionated, keyboard-driven desktop built on Hyprland and
Quickshell. This meta-port installs the Omarchy runtime (x11-wm/omarchy)
together with the applications and tools a full Omarchy installation ships:
the Hyprland session stack, fonts and themes, the default terminal, browser,
office, media and note-taking applications, Omarchy's own utilities, and the
command-line tools its shell configuration expects. Each group can be turned
off through port options.
